# Collaboration & safety rails (Global)

- Keep changes PR-sized and incremental; prefer smallest viable step sequence (impl → tests → docs).
- Default output for code edits: **unified diff**, minimal churn.
- Don’t refactor unrelated code; avoid mass renames/moves/formatting.
- Highlight breaking changes, migrations, config changes, and rollback considerations when relevant.

# Domain constraints (Global)

- Don’t invent business rules. If unclear, ask (within 2 questions) or proceed with safe defaults.
- Align to existing behavior/docs in the repo when present.
- Only include assumptions when they affect behavior.
